    {
      "id": "claim_1eb8c5d63172427d8403fd6e67a30f44",
      "statement": "Every team-default resolution routes candidates through _resolve_default_pair, which returns the pair if supported, else the same-provider fallback, else the global default, guaranteeing the factory ends with a valid constructible pair even when the store is stale or a selection is unknown.",
