      "statement": "get_team_default_model resolves distinct defaults per role (agent/reviewer/chat), where the chat role inherits the team agent default when no chat-specific model is configured, and separate resolvers exist for the diff-grouping pass (inheriting reviewer subagent) and the thread-title model.",
